  ($v$mayco$v$, $v$stoneware-gloss$v$, $v$SW-503$v$, $v$Orange Gloss$v$, $v$mayco-orange-gloss$v$, $v$glaze$v$, $v$Orange Gloss is a highly-pigmented bright orange gloss glaze$v$, $v$#f75926$v$, $v$orange$v$, array[$v$orange$v$]::text[], $v$gloss$v$, $v$opaque$v$, 5, 10, true, $v$Cone 6: Orange Gloss is a highly-pigmented bright orange gloss glaze. The stable qualities of this glaze make it ideal for design work and full opaque coverage at mid-range temperatures. Cone 10: Color darkens.$v$, $v$https://www.maycocolors.com/product/sw-503-orange-gloss/$v$, null, null, null, $v$https://www.maycocolors.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/sw-503.jpg$v$, $v$Mayco$v$),
