  ($v$SW-465$v$, $v$white$v$, $v$White clay body$v$, 10, $v$reduction$v$, null, $v$Puffed texture may increase. Color darkens. Tips for Use: Layer Together: Moon Rocks can be layered with other Moon Rock colors to create stunning visual effects. Allow the first layer to set slightly (loses its glossiness) before adding the next. Alternate directions of coats (apply one layer vertically and the next layer horizontally). 1-2 coats of each color are recommended, but additional coats will produce a more pronounced puffed pattern. Use with Underglazes and Engobes: Moon Rocks remains dimensional when applied over Underglazes and Stoneware Engobes, preserving its raised texture. For best results, it is recommended to bisque fire the Underglaze or Engobe to$v$, $v$https://www.maycocolors.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/sw465_cone10.jpg$v$, $v$https://www.maycocolors.com/product/sw465-black-moon-rocks/$v$),
